      "description": "This instance's pages for the platform's docs site: the WHO SMART DAK and IG authoring guides and the WHO SMART content types, which document this instance's processes and the DAK/IG work it carries. Moved here from the harness below on 2026-10-23 (wrong-direction move M8, and the WHO sections of the content-types page). A SEPARATE directory from `docs/`, which is this instance's IG pages, wholly generated by `smart-base:pages` (its check reports any other file there as an orphan), and from `findings/`, which is mounted rather than composed. Composed THROUGH just-the-docs (`composed: true`, as the content core's own docs directory is), so its pages land in the platform's site under this instance's name with the sidebar, search and layout. `docs.json` here declares the `docs-source` the platform's one docs-page run reads (owner ruling A1, 2026-10-23): each `source/<group>-<slug>/` renders into `<group>/<slug>.md` beside it, and `compose-docs` leaves `source/` itself out.",
